{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-15295-r4531769","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Albanian Fried Meatballs","sourcePageId":15295,"sourceRevision":"4531769","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-08-21T00:49:22Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Albanian%20Fried%20Meatballs&oldid=4531769","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:17:17.771Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Albanian recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Pan fried recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using bread","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using feta","Category:Recipes using meat","Category:Recipes using mint","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes without cooking time"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"81761b45d4e7f4ded6c2fdd4dd5f539db02f3d5679f698bf39d5c5e31b03cd34","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Meat recipes\n| Cuisine = Albanian\n| Servings = 4\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Albania|Cuisine of Albania]] | [[Cookbook:Meat Recipes|Meat Recipes]]\n\n'''Fried meatballs''' ('''''qofte të fërguara''''') is an Albanian dish.\n\n==Ingredients==\n*1 slice stale [[Cookbook:Bread|bread]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] ground [[Cookbook:Meat|meat]]\n*1 small [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], finely-[[Cookbook:Grating|grated]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Feta_Cheese|feta]] cheese\n*2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]\n*2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Oil|oil]] or melted [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n*1 tablespoon chopped [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n*[[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n*[[Cookbook:Mint|Mint]]\n*[[Cookbook:Oregano|Oregano]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n*1 cup [[Cookbook:Oil|oil]] ([[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]] recommended)\n\n==Procedure==\n#Soak bread in water and squeeze hard to drain. \n#Combine soaked bread, ground meat, bread crumbs, oil or melted butter, onion, cheese, parsley, salt, pepper, and mint, and mix thoroughly.\n#Form mixture into 1 [[Cookbook:Inch|inch]]-thick patties, then sprinkle with salt, pepper, and oregano. \n#Roll in flour and [[Cookbook:Frying|fry]] in hot oil. \n#Serve hot with French fries or mashed potatoes.\n\n==References==\n''This article contains information from [http://www.frosina.org Frosina.org] and it is used with [[w:User:Dori/www.frosina.org permission|permission]].''\n\n[[Category:Recipes using meat|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Pan fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Albanian recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Albanian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread]]\n[[Category:Recipes using feta]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mint]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Albanian Fried Meatballs","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"4","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 slice stale bread","sourceText":"1 slice stale bread","amountText":"1 slice stale bread","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 lb ground meat","sourceText":"1 lb ground meat","amountText":"1 lb g